Searching for video switcher rental usually turns up two very different products: a presentation switcher that cuts a room's screen between a laptop and a DVD player, and a camera or vision mixer built for live streaming and broadcast production. Our [technical support for events](/blog/technical-support-for-events/#switching-between-multiple-presentation-sources) guide already mentions our switcher in one short section, framed as something the technician manages during an event. This page is the deeper, equipment first version: exactly what we stock, what it is not, which packages it is realistically available on, and an honest comparison against running a single presentation source.

Malaga Event Gear owns this device ourselves and deploys it with a technician, across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. What follows is one real product, described honestly, including where our certainty about it stops, not a rewritten spec sheet.

