## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear stocks one video switcher, a Kramer VP-731 with 9 inputs, as a separate item from its standard event packages. It is real inventory, deployed with a technician on bookings that use more than one presentation source, across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol. It is not bundled into the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) or [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/), and there is no published a la carte price, so [contact us](/contact/) with your event details and we will confirm availability and a quote.

The single most important thing to understand about this device: it is a presentation switcher for your screen, not a camera switcher, vision mixer or streaming production tool. Cameras, filming and live streaming are not in our own inventory, and our own crew does not run them. If your event needs one of them, let us know and we can sound out our suppliers, with no promise that one can cover it. See [Video Switcher vs Camera Switcher](#video-switcher-vs-camera-switcher-the-question-that-matters-most) below.

