## How Far in Advance to Book

Book as early as you can once your event date, venue and agenda are confirmed. Demand on the Costa del Sol peaks during the corporate conference season and around major congresses, when technicians fill up first. Because the video switcher is a single unit in our inventory and requires a technician on site to operate, confirming it early also gives us time to check it is genuinely free on your date, alongside whichever package you have already booked.

